<title>HONG KONG: Trade in HK Toy Centre shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in HK Toy Centre shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of toy maker Hong Kong Toy Centre International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
